{"chapter": "obsolete", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0AS3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$M$", "MATH_0002": "$A$", "MATH_0003": "$M \\otimes_A \\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "MATH_0005": "$M \\otimes_A \\mathcal{O}_X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{resolve-situation-rational}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-double-dual-rational}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b01b0b3b12ef520fe8f0034e29d12295c4f48e34fb353ad447ea3feaab6ff9e0", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:48c4a29482b090c85ec5d955bf62e014abf2c7c4482124c09f022e544a127f15", "source_text": "In Resolution of Surfaces, Situation <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0001> be a finite reflexive <MATH_0002>-module. Let <MATH_0003>\ndenote the pullback of the associated <MATH_0004>-module. Then\n<MATH_0005> maps onto its double dual.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:beee84922d7f2df9e781a2edb00ca5fe306a64be0d5bdbdd0e7b3f2409dcbb44", "unit_id": "tag:0B50:statement"}
